false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[14,19,64,51,73,72],"title":1,"rank":"1","loyalty":"120","reputation":"5550","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1017005","helmet":"WP1027305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10128","city":"CS1039","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[14,19,64,51,73,72],"title":1,"rank":"1","loyalty":"120","reputation":"6550","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1017005","helmet":"WP1027305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10128","city":"CS1039","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[14,19,64,51,73,72],"title":1,"rank":"1","loyalty":"120","reputation":"6550","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1017005","helmet":"WP1027305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10128","city":"CS1039","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[14,19,64,51,73,72],"title":1,"rank":"1","loyalty":"120","reputation":"7550","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1017005","helmet":"WP1027305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1039","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[14,19,64,51,73,72],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"900","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1017005","helmet":"WP1027305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10128","city":"CS1039","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[14,19,64,51,73,72],"title":1,"rank":"1","loyalty":"100","reputation":"4000","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1017005","helmet":"WP1027305"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"刘备次子，刘禅庶弟，封鲁王、甘陵王。章武元年六月，刘备派司徒许靖封刘永为鲁王。建兴八年，刘禅因鲁、梁两地的地理位置在中分天下的吴国境内，所以改封弟弟鲁王刘永为甘陵王。刘永因憎恶宦官黄皓，遭谗言被刘禅疏远，十余年不得朝见。蜀亡后迁往洛阳，任奉车都尉，封爵乡侯。","tc":"劉備次子，劉禪庶弟，封魯王、甘陵王。章武元年六月，劉備派司徒許靖封劉永為魯王。建興八年，劉禪因魯、梁兩地的地理位置在中分天下的吳國境內，所以改封弟弟魯王劉永為甘陵王。劉永因憎惡宦官黃皓，遭讒言被劉禪疏遠，十余年不得朝見。蜀亡后遷往洛陽，任奉車都尉，封爵鄉侯。","en":"The second son of Liu Bei and a younger half-brother of Liu Shan. He was enfeoffed as Prince of Lu and later as Prince of Ganling. In the sixth month of the first year of Zhangwu, Liu Bei dispatched Senior Minister Xu Jing to invest Liu Yong as Prince of Lu. In the eighth year of Jianxing, because the territories of Lu and Liang lay within Wu's borders, Liu Shan re-enfeoffed his brother as Prince of Ganling. Liu Yong bore an enmity toward the eunuch Huang Hao, who used slander to turn Liu Shan against him, resulting in over ten years during which Liu Yong was denied any audience with the emperor. After the fall of Shu, he was relocated to Luoyang, where he served as Commandant of the Imperial Carriages and received the noble title of Marquis of a Rural District.","jp":"劉備の次男で、劉禅の異母弟。魯王、甘陵王に封じられた。章武元年6月、劉備は司徒の許靖を遣わして劉永を魯王に封じた。建興8年、劉禅は魯と梁の地が天下を二分した際の呉の領内に位置することから、弟である魯王劉永を改封して甘陵王とした。劉永は宦官の黄皓を憎悪していたため、その讒言によって劉禅に疎まれ、十余年もの間朝見を許されなかった。蜀の滅亡後は洛陽へ移り、奉車都尉に任じられ、郷侯に封じられた。","kr":"유비의 차남이자 유선의 이복동생으로, 노왕과 감릉왕에 봉해졌다. 장무 원년 6월, 유비가 사도 허정을 파견하여 유영을 노왕으로 책봉했다. 건흥 8년, 유선은 노와 양 두 지역의 위치가 천하를 양분한 오나라 영토 내에 있다는 이유로 아우인 노왕 유영을 감릉왕으로 개봉했다. 유영은 환관 황호를 증오하다가 그의 참소를 입어 유선에게 소원해졌고, 십여 년 동안 조현하지 못했다. 촉이 멸망한 후 낙양으로 이주하여 봉거도위를 지냈으며 향후에 봉해졌다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1024915","remark":"","surname":"刘","surnameTc":"劉","surnameEn":"Liu","surnameJp":"劉","surnameKr":"유","surnameOther":"","name":"永","nameTc":"永","nameEn":"Yong","nameJp":"永","nameKr":"영","nameOther":"","word":"公寿","wordTc":"公壽","wordEn":"Gongshou","wordJp":"公寿","wordKr":"공수","wordOther":"","icon":"刘永","power":"WJ10011",